+### Switch 2 titles
+
+A Switch 2 title (experimental, [NX2_PORT.md](NX2_PORT.md)) starts with eden-nx2's own choices. In the
+settings file only, `"switch2"` at the top level changes them for every Switch 2 title, and one inside
+a game's entry under `"games"` for that game, whose values go first:
+
+```json
+  "switch2": { "gpu_split": true, "exact_gpu": false, "reactive_flushing": false },
+  "games": { "0400380020056000": { "switch2": { "gpu_split": false } } }
+```
+
+- `gpu_split`: eden-nx2's split GPU thread (on): more throughput where the GPU thread is the limit,
+  one more busy CPU core. Off gives the core back.
+- `exact_gpu`: Eden's exact GPU accuracy instead of its lowest (off); the split GPU thread runs
+  only without it.
+- `reactive_flushing`: Eden's reactive flushing (off).
+
 ## Button mapping
 
 **Settings > Controls > Vibration strength** sets how strong the DualSense vibrates, from 25% to 100% of what a game asks for; **Vibration** turns it off altogether.
